    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0003_794d80c18c9d.png\"/>\n$\\begin{aligned} & O(x, y)=\\text { centre } \\\\ & \\Rightarrow O C=O A=O B=O D \\\\ & \\Rightarrow r=\\frac{\\sqrt{65}}{2}\\end{aligned}$"
